              "chapter": 29,
              "v_start": 1,
              "v_end": 1,
              "text": "Captives — There were two carryings into Babylon, the latter about eleven or twelve years after the former, the first was in the time of Jehoiakim, When the princes, and all the mighty men of valour, even ten thousand captives, and all the craftsmen and smiths were carried away."
            }
          ]
